{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37378","headline":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 一 · 唐彦谦","name":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫贱如故旧，少壮即相依。\n中心不敢厌，但觉少光辉。\n向来乘时士，亦有能奋飞。\n一朝权势歇，欲退无所归。\n不如行其素，辛苦奈寒饥。\n人生系天运，何用发深悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}